    "biography": {
      "concept": "Commander of the Noodle Guard at Soft Landing's inflatable gate (Act 2)",
      "notes": "Captain Rudy Falk commands the Noodle Guard at Soft Landing's inflatable gate, in a cardboard-and-silver-tape mech costume he has decided is a uniform. He has a foam clipboard, a stamp that goes BOING, forms in triplicate and immense seriousness. Anything with an edge (blades, hard words, dates) gets confiscated into a bin marked EDGES; the bin bounces. Every form in the guardhouse is dated 'today'. He is clipped, courteous and quietly delighted by cooperation. 'Mind the step. There isn't one.'"
    }
